          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "In this section we will revisit some algebraic identities that we have studied in earlier grades and try to visualise them using geometrical models. In particular, we will use squares and rectangles to represent terms."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.333,
            0.886,
            0.374
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Consider two line segments of lengths a and b units, respectively, and make a longer line segment of length (a + b) units as shown in Fig. 4.1."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 7,
